WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.000
Colombo. A coastal capital where humid heat meets markets and harbours.

2
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:10.950
Heat advisories ask people to work in the shade. Market and fish workers often cannot.

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:16.570
The city has worked on guidelines for a heat plan that takes women’s work into account.

4
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:21.070
Advice works when it fits how people earn a living.
